<div id="algorithm1.6.21" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.21.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.21.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  where </span><math id="algorithm1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{d}:\mathbb{R}^{d_{in}}\rightarrow\mathbb{R}^{8}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">R</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></msub></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">→</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">8</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{d}:\mathbb{R}^{d_{in}}\rightarrow\mathbb{R}^{8}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.21.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> is the deep local router</span>
